A resource that can be used to identify products with recycled content is the 
"Comprehensive Procurement Guidelines (CPG)" page within the EPA's website at 
http://www.epa.gov.  Other products with recycled content are also acceptable 
when meeting all requirements of this specification.  <BRK/>
